   </table><p style="padding-bottom:1pt;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;border-bottom:0.75pt solid;margin-right:86.667%;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:6pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </span></p><p style="text-indent:-4.749%;padding-left:4.533%;font-size:10pt;margin-top:2pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">* Less than 1%.</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </span></p><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="display:flex;margin-top:0;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:4.537%;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:4.537%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">(1)</span><div style="display:inline;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Unless otherwise indicated, the address for each director and executive officer is c/o Mastech Digital, Inc., 1305 Cherrington Parkway, Building 210, Suite 400, Moon Township, Pennsylvania 15108. The number of shares beneficially owned by each person as of March 31, 2026, includes shares of Common Stock that such person or group has the right to acquire within 60 days of March 31, 2026, upon the exercise of stock options or vesting of restricted shares. For each individual included in the table, percentage ownership is calculated by dividing the number of shares beneficially owned by such person or group by the sum of the 11,875,706 shares of Common Stock outstanding on March 31, 2026, plus the shares of Common Stock that such person or group has the right to acquire within 60 days of March 31, 2026. </span></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="display:flex;margin-top:0;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:4.537%;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:4.537%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">(2)</span><div style="display:inline;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Includes: (i) 857,144 shares held by a revocable trust of Mr. Wadhwani; (ii) 86,664 shares held by two family trusts over which Mr. Wadhwani has investment and voting power; and (iii) 303,332 shares owned by a family limited partnership for which Mr. Wadhwani is a majority-in-interest general partner. </span></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="display:flex;margin-top:0;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:4.537%;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:4.537%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">(3)</span><div style="display:inline;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Includes: (i) 857,144 shares held by a revocable trust of Mr. Trivedi; (ii) 236,942 shares owned by family limited partnerships for which Mr. Trivedi is a majority-in-interest general partner; and (iii) 829,000 shares held by a family trust over which, Mr. Trivedi, as co-trustee, has shared investment and voting power. </span></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="display:flex;margin-top:0;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:4.537%;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:4.537%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">(4)</span><div style="display:inline;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Based on the information contained in Schedule 13G/A filed with the SEC on February 8, 2023. According to the Schedule 13G/A, the business address of Manoj Singh is Putnam Investments, 1 Post Office Square, Boston, MA 02109. </span></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="display:flex;margin-top:0;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:4.537%;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:4.537%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">(5)</span><div style="display:inline;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Based solely on the information contained in Form 4 filed with the SEC on March 03, 2026. Includes 40,000 shares held in a trust for Mr. Shaw&#8217;s sister for which Mr. Shaw is sole trustee. According to the Schedule 13G/A, the business address of Mr. Shaw is 503 13</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:super;font-size:5.025pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">th</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> Avenue East, #205, Seattle, WA 98102. </span></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="display:flex;margin-top:0;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:4.537%;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:4.537%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">(6)</span><div style="display:inline;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Based solely on the information contained in Schedule 13G/A filed with the SEC on January 30, 2026. According to the Schedule 13G/A, the business address of The Capital Management Corporation is 4101 Cox Road, Suite 110, Glen Allen, VA 23060. </span></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="display:flex;margin-top:0;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:4.537%;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:4.537%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">(7)</span><div style="display:inline;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Mr. Patel was appointed as the Company&#8217;s President and Chief Executive Officer effective January 6, 2025. </span></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="display:flex;margin-top:0;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:4.537%;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:4.537%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">(8)</span><div style="display:inline;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Mr. Sugantharaman was appointed the Company's Chief Financial Officer effective April 14, 2025.</span></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="display:fl