  <div class="main-content-container" style="z-index:5;position:relative;"><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="display:flex;margin-top:0;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:4.537%;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:4.537%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">(13)</span><div style="display:inline;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Mr. Patel earned a 2025 annual performance bonus totaling $616,932.   On March 30, 2026, Mr. Patel and the Company agreed to pay such bonus in the form of restricted shares, subject to immediate vesting.  The Compensation Committee of the Board determined the number of awarded restricted shares based on a 30-day volume-weighted average price (VWAP) of $6.15.  Mr. Patel received 100,314 restricted shares, which are included in Mr. Patel's total above as of March 31, 2026.</span></div></div><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</span></p></div>
